    - Pick frame border color(s): either one color for all 4 frames, or two colors (one per diagonal pair). Frame colors disjoint from P1, P2, and bg palette.
    - Pick 4 non-overlapping axis-aligned square regions of side S, one per quadrant, with small jitter. Assign s1.s, s1.d, s2, blank randomly to the four positions.
